# Scratch Org Definition File Reference

**CRITICAL RULE**: When working with `project-scratch-def.json` or any scratch org definition file, NEVER hallucinate or assume configuration values. ONLY use the configuration options documented in this reference, which is compiled from official Salesforce documentation.

**Official Documentation Sources**:
- [Scratch Org Definition File](https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_scratch_orgs_def_file.htm)
- [Configuration Values Reference](https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_scratch_orgs_def_file_config_values.htm)

## File Structure

A scratch org definition file is a JSON file with the following structure:

```json
{
  "orgName": "string",
  "edition": "string",
  "country": "string (optional)",
  "username": "string (optional)",
  "adminEmail": "string (optional)",
  "description": "string (optional)",
  "language": "string (optional)",
  "features": ["array of feature strings"],
  "settings": {
    "settingName": {
      "settingProperty": "value"
    }
  },
  "objectSettings": {
    "objectName": {
      "sharingModel": "string"
    }
  },
  "hasSampleData": false,
  "orgPreferences": {
    "enabled": ["array of preference strings"],
    "disabled": ["array of preference strings"]
  }
}
```

## Required Properties

### edition (REQUIRED)
Specifies the Salesforce edition for the scratch org.

**Valid Values**:
- `"Developer"`
- `"Enterprise"`
- `"Group"`
- `"Professional"`

**Example**:
```json
{
  "edition": "Developer"
}
```

### orgName (REQUIRED)
The name of the scratch org.

**Example**:
```json
{
  "orgName": "My Scratch Org"
}
```

## Optional Properties

### country
The country for the org. Default is "US".

**Valid Values**: Any valid ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (e.g., "US", "GB", "FR", "DE", "JP")

**Example**:
```json
{
  "country": "US"
}
```

### username
The username for the admin user. If not specified, Salesforce generates one.

**Format**: Must be in email format but doesn't need to be a real email address.

**Example**:
```json
{
  "username": "admin@mycompany.org"
}
```

### adminEmail
The email address for the admin user.

**Example**:
```json
{
  "adminEmail": "admin@mycompany.com"
}
```

### description
Description of the scratch org.

**Example**:
```json
{
  "description": "Scratch org for feature development"
}
```

### language
The default language for the org. Default is "en_US".

**Valid Values**: Any valid Salesforce locale code (e.g., "en_US", "en_GB", "fr", "de", "es", "ja")

**Example**:
```json
{
  "language": "en_US"
}
```

### hasSampleData
Whether to include sample data in the scratch org.

**Valid Values**: `true` or `false` (default: `false`)

**Example**:
```json
{
  "hasSampleData": false
}
```

## Features Array

The `features` array enables specific Salesforce features. ONLY use features from this validated list:

### Core Platform Features
- `"API"`
- `"AuthorApex"`
- `"Communities"`
- `"ContactsToMultipleAccounts"`
- `"ContractApprovals"`
- `"CustomerSelfService"`
- `"CustomApps"`
- `"CustomTab"`
- `"DebugApex"`
- `"DefaultWorkflowUser"`
- `"Entitlements"`
- `"ExternalSharing"`
- `"FlowRunTimeApi"`
- `"ForceComPlatform"`
- `"Interaction"`
- `"IoT"`
- `"Knowledge"`
- `"LightningExperience"`
- `"LiveAgent"`
- `"LiveMessage"`
- `"MultiCurrency"`
- `"PersonAccounts"`
- `"ProcessBuilder"`
- `"SalesWave"`
- `"ServiceCloud"`
- `"ServiceWave"`
- `"SiteDotCom"`
- `"Sites"`
- `"StateAndCountryPicklist"`
- `"Workflow"`

### Einstein and AI Features
- `"Einstein"`
- `"EinsteinAgentStudio"`
- `"EinsteinBots"`
- `"EinsteinConversationInsights"`
- `"EinsteinDocumentCapture"`
- `"EinsteinGenerativeAI"`
- `"Einstein1AIPlatform"` (Enables Agentforce, Prompt Builder, Model Builder)
- `"EinsteinPlatform"`

### Security and Identity Features
- `"Identity"`
- `"IdentityConnect"`
- `"SingleSignOn"`
- `"EnableSetPasswordInApi"`
- `"TwoFactorAuthentication"`

### Sales and Service Features
- `"SalesConsole"`
- `"ServiceConsole"`
- `"SalesforceIQ"`
- `"CascadeDelete"`
- `"MaxApexCodeSize"`
- `"MaxCustomLabels"`

### Developer and Integration Features
- `"ChangeDataCapture"`
- `"EventLogFile"`
- `"EventMonitoring"`
- `"FieldAuditTrail"`
- `"FieldHistoryTracking"`
- `"DataPipelines"`

### Mobile Features
- `"SalesforceMobileApp"`
- `"MobileOffline"`

**Example**:
```json
{
  "features": [
    "Einstein1AIPlatform",
    "EnableSetPasswordInApi",
    "Communities",
    "ServiceCloud",
    "FlowRunTimeApi"
  ]
}
```

## Settings Object

The `settings` object configures various Salesforce settings. ONLY use settings from this validated list:

### lightningExperienceSettings
Controls Lightning Experience configuration.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableS1DesktopEnabled"`: boolean - Enable Lightning Experience

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "lightningExperienceSettings": {
      "enableS1DesktopEnabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

### einsteinGptSettings
Controls Einstein Generative AI settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableEinsteinGptPlatform"`: boolean - Enable Einstein Generative AI platform

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "einsteinGptSettings": {
      "enableEinsteinGptPlatform": true
    }
  }
}
```

### agentPlatformSettings
Controls Agentforce platform settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableAgentPlatform"`: boolean - Enable Agentforce capabilities

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "agentPlatformSettings": {
      "enableAgentPlatform": true
    }
  }
}
```

### mobileSettings
Controls mobile app settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableS1EncryptedStoragePref2"`: boolean
- `"enableMobileLiteAccess"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "mobileSettings": {
      "enableS1EncryptedStoragePref2": false
    }
  }
}
```

### securitySettings
Controls security-related settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableAdminLoginAsAnyUser"`: boolean
- `"enableAuditFieldsInactiveOwner"`: boolean
- `"enableRequireHttpsConnection"`: boolean
- `"sessionSettings"`: object with properties:
  - `"forceRelogin"`: boolean
  - `"sessionTimeout"`: string (e.g., "TwoHours", "FourHours", "EightHours", "TwelveHours")

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "securitySettings": {
      "enableAdminLoginAsAnyUser": true,
      "sessionSettings": {
        "forceRelogin": false,
        "sessionTimeout": "TwelveHours"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### chatterSettings
Controls Chatter configuration.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableChatter"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "chatterSettings": {
      "enableChatter": true
    }
  }
}
```

### communitiesSettings
Controls Experience Cloud (Communities) settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableNetworksEnabled"`: boolean
- `"enableInvitationsEnabled"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "communitiesSettings": {
      "enableNetworksEnabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

### languageSettings
Controls language and translation settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableTranslationWorkbench"`: boolean
- `"enablePlatformLanguage"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "languageSettings": {
      "enableTranslationWorkbench": true
    }
  }
}
```

### searchSettings
Controls search configuration.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableEinsteinSearchNaturalLanguage"`: boolean
- `"enableCustomTabs"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "searchSettings": {
      "enableEinsteinSearchNaturalLanguage": true
    }
  }
}
```

### pathAssistantSettings
Controls Path Assistant configuration.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enablePathAssistant"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "pathAssistantSettings": {
      "enablePathAssistant": true
    }
  }
}
```

### entitlementSettings
Controls entitlement management.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableEntitlements"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "entitlementSettings": {
      "enableEntitlements": true
    }
  }
}
```

### knowledgeSettings
Controls Salesforce Knowledge settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableKnowledge"`: boolean
- `"enableLightningKnowledge"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "knowledgeSettings": {
      "enableKnowledge": true,
      "enableLightningKnowledge": true
    }
  }
}
```

### caseSettings
Controls Case management settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableEarlyEscalationRuleTriggers"`: boolean
- `"enableEmailToCase"`: boolean
- `"enableWebToCase"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "caseSettings": {
      "enableEmailToCase": true
    }
  }
}
```

### workDotComSettings
Controls Work.com settings.

**Valid Properties**:
- `"enableWorkDotCom"`: boolean

**Example**:
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "workDotComSettings": {
      "enableWorkDotCom": true
    }
  }
}
```

## objectSettings Object

Configure sharing models for standard and custom objects.

**Valid Sharing Models**:
- `"Private"`
- `"Public"`
- `"ReadOnly"`
- `"ReadWrite"`
- `"ControlledByParent"`
- `"ControlledByCampaign"`
- `"ControlledByLeadOrContact"`

**Example**:
```json
{
  "objectSettings": {
    "account": {
      "sharingModel": "ReadWrite"
    },
    "contact": {
      "sharingModel": "ReadWrite"
    },
    "opportunity": {
      "sharingModel": "Private"
    },
    "case": {
      "sharingModel": "ReadOnly"
    }
  }
}
```

## orgPreferences Object

Enable or disable specific org preferences.

**Structure**:
```json
{
  "orgPreferences": {
    "enabled": ["preference1", "preference2"],
    "disabled": ["preference3", "preference4"]
  }
}
```

**Common Preferences**:
- `"S1DesktopEnabled"` - Enable Lightning Experience
- `"ChatterEnabled"` - Enable Chatter
- `"IsAccountTeamsEnabled"` - Enable Account Teams
- `"IsOpportunityTeamEnabled"` - Enable Opportunity Teams
- `"ShowViewHierarchyLink"` - Show View Hierarchy link
- `"IsQuoteEnabled"` - Enable Quotes
- `"IsContractHistoryTrackingEnabled"` - Enable Contract History
- `"IsOrderEnabled"` - Enable Orders
- `"IsReductionOrdersEnabled"` - Enable Reduction Orders
- `"IsWorkOrderEnabled"` - Enable Work Orders
- `"IsAssetEnabled"` - Enable Assets

**Example**:
```json
{
  "orgPreferences": {
    "enabled": [
      "S1DesktopEnabled",
      "ChatterEnabled",
      "IsAccountTeamsEnabled"
    ],
    "disabled": [
      "IsOpportunityTeamEnabled"
    ]
  }
}
```

